{
  "id": "RAW_0df8702ea1",
  "title": "一句话让 AI 创造 3D 世界：小红书开源 3DCodeFactory",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4OTc2MzczNg==&mid=2247497241&idx=1&sn=a61dd75ab206dca94419055ef76dd1e4",
  "date": "2026-11-25 17:59:00",
  "author": "小红书技术REDtech",
  "siteName": "小红书技术REDtech",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;padding:0px 7px;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;text-decoration-style:solid;text-autospace:normal;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;\">\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"caret-color:rgb(0, 0, 0);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration:none;text-decoration-style:solid;font-style:normal;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:start;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125142309_48d4fed.png\"></span></p>\n   <div style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;font-variant-caps:normal;padding:0px 7px;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;text-decoration-style:solid;text-autospace:normal;font-style:normal;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 30px;transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 100 100 0%;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 3px;border-left: 3px solid rgba(160, 160, 160, 0.32);height: auto;margin: 0px 0px 0px 14px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"margin: 5px 0px;transform: translate3d(-5px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(160, 160, 160);line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>导读</span></strong></span></p>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin: 5px 0px 20px;transform: translate3d(-5px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(160, 160, 160);line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>用代码做出一把椅子或者一盏台灯并不难，但要搭建出一座图书馆、一片自然森林或者一个能在网页里实时交互的街区，往往需要编写数千乃至上万行代码，并在环境里经过上百轮交互调优。然而，现有的开源 3D 代码数据大多只包含简单单物体的单轮代码，面向复杂场景的多轮训练数据十分匮乏。</span></p>\n        <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>为此，小红书提出大规模全自动 3D 数据合成框架 3DCodeFactory。无需依赖存量 3D 资产，只需从互联网海量的通用纯文本出发，即可全自动合成复杂 3D 建模任务与配套的多维验收标准，并通过沙箱实机评测筛选出高质量的多轮交互轨迹。基于该框架，团队构建并开源了数据集 3DCodeFactory-Data，包含 5,045 个复杂 3D 任务与多轮交互轨迹，单条轨迹平均超过 100 万 tokens，单场景代码量中位数达 4,270 行，总规模达 5.52B tokens。</span></p>\n        <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>在 BlenderWorld、P3D-Bench 与 3DCodeBench 等评测基准上，基于 3DCodeFactory-Data 微调 1 个 Epoch 的 Qwen3.8-27B 综合性能超越同系列 2.4T 旗舰模型 Qwen3.8-Max，并一致大幅领先基于现有开源 3D 代码数据集训练的模型，显著提升了复杂三维场景构建与交互开发能力。</span></p>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(160, 160, 160);line-height: 2;box-sizing: border-box;\"></p>\n      <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n       <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"word-break: break-all;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>项目主页：</span></strong></p>\n        <p style=\"word-break: break-all;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span><a href=\"https://3dcodefactory.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\">https://3dcodefactory.github.io/</a></span></p>\n       </li>\n       <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"word-break: break-all;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>代码：</span></strong></p>\n        <p style=\"word-break: break-all;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span><a href=\"https://github.com/3DCodeFactory/3DCodeFactory\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/3DCodeFactory/3DCodeFactory</a></span></p>\n       </li>\n       <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"word-break: break-all;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>3DCodeFactory-Data 数据集：</span></strong></p>\n        <p style=\"word-break: break-all;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/3DCodeFactory/3DCodeFactory\" target=\"_blank\">https://huggingface.co/datasets/3DCodeFactory/3DCodeFactory</a></span></p>\n       </li>\n       <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <p style=\"word-break: break-all;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>论文：</span></strong></p>\n        <p style=\"word-break: break-all;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2611.28783\" target=\"_blank\">https://arxiv.org/pdf/2611.28783</a></span></p>\n       </li>\n      </ul>\n      <p></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 50px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>01</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"letter-spacing:1px;font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:justify;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>背景与挑战</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 15px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>随着代码智能体能力提升，3D 代码生成正从简单几何体迈向复杂场景与动态交互开发。然而，现有 3D 代码数据集大多由存量三维资产逆向转换而来，局限于静态单物体的单轮代码，既难以扩展场景复杂度，也缺少编写代码后通过渲染看图检查并反复修改的多轮反馈过程。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>要突破存量资产的限制，亟需一套从零正向合成复杂 3D 数据的可扩展方案。一个自然的思路是利用互联网上广泛存在的通用纯文本（如文生图 prompt、商品描述）直接合成多轮 3D 训练数据，但这需要解决三个问题：</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;transform: translate3d(3px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px 5px;box-sizing: border-box;\"></p>\n    <ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n     <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>缺乏视觉参照时，仅靠文本扩写需求容易陷入重复模板，难以定义细粒度三维结构；</span></p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>合成任务没有现成的三维参考模型与测试脚本，难以自动评估视觉、规格与交互质量；</span></p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>通用文本夹杂大量无三维主体的描述，且类别分布与真实 3D 建模需求差异较大。</span></p>\n     </li>\n    </ol>\n    <p></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 40px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>02</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"letter-spacing:1px;font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:justify;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>3DCodeFactory：面向三维代码智能体的训练数据规模化合成</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>针对上述问题，3DCodeFactory 通过三阶段全自动管线构建复杂多轮 3D 训练数据：</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;color: rgb(236, 43, 43);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>1. 3D 分类体系与语料分布对齐</span></span></strong></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>我们归并了多类主流三维资产平台的目录结构，构建涵盖&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>10 个一级领域、56 个细分类别</span></strong><span>的 3D 分类树。通过对原始文本去重清洗、提取三维主体并映射至分类树叶节点，框架对高频类别降采样，并对工业器械、科研医疗设备等长尾类别定向检索补齐，得到类别均衡的种子池。</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125142309_8e4ec03.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>图1 ：3D 内容分类体系与语料分布对齐</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;color: rgb(236, 43, 43);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>2. 参考图引导的任务与评分准则合成</span></span></strong></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>为解决纯文本扩写缺乏空间细节与无真值难以验收的问题，框架以合成参考图为“视觉锚点”，协同生成结构化需求与配套评分准则（下图）：</span></p>\n    <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n     <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>视觉参考图生成：</span></strong><span>将种子文本转化为候选三维图像，过滤低质量样本后，保留结构清晰的图像作为视觉锚点，为后续需求生成提供具象的空间与几何参照；</span></p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>任务生成：</span></strong><span>明确任务应用背景与目标环境，并以参考图为基准提炼核心三维主体、补足单张 2D 图像无法体现的三维尺寸比例与空间排布参数，同时强制要求构建真实三维网格而非用平面贴图替代；针对 Three.js 任务，围绕三维主体进一步设计部件运动控制、环境状态切换或视角联动等可触发的交互需求，使任务从静态建模延伸至动态可交互场景；</span></p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>配套多维评分准则生成：</span></strong><span>在生成任务的同时，同步拆解出多档量化的视觉准则（全局布局至局部形体）、规格准则（几何尺度与工程交付）与功能准则（触发动作与状态响应），并预估几何难度用于后续视觉得分校准，为无现成三维真值的合成任务提供可执行的验收依据。</span></p>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125142309_aa20b0f.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;color: rgb(236, 43, 43);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>3. 多轮沙箱采样与实机验证筛选</span></span></strong></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>代码智能体接收到合成的任务需求后，会在隔离的沙箱环境里开始工作。它通过编写代码、执行渲染、观察画面反馈，不断进行多轮迭代修正，最终提交产物与交互轨迹。在验证阶段，框架将提交产物挂载回相同运行环境中，从视觉质量与规格功能两个维度开展实机评估（下图）：</span></p>\n    <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-2\">\n     <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>视觉质量评估：</span></strong><span>视觉取证智能体主动旋转、缩放与调整相机采集多视角互补图像，并根据相机运动中画面是否出现穿模、闪烁或裁切评估展示稳定性得分；随后，视觉判别器对照参考图与视觉准则逐项核验得出视觉准则得分，同时评估整体美学得分，并利用先验任务难度对复杂几何对象的视觉得分进行校准；</span></p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>规格与功能评估：</span></strong><span>验收智能体对照规格与功能准则，一方面检查源码并运行测试脚本核验各项规格要求（计算规格得分），另一方面逐一触发交互控件，检验操作前后的状态与画面变化（计算功能得分）。</span></p>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>每个任务持续开展独立采样，剔除任意维度未达准入阈值的样本，仅保留五项指标全部达标的合格轨迹并择优纳入训练集。双盲人工评测显示，该筛选机制对缺陷轨迹的拦截准确率达 87.2%，召回率达 91.1%，同题成对偏好（GSB）人机一致率达 77.3%。</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125142309_01c8256.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>图2: 参考图引导的任务与评分准则合成流程</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 50px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>03</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"letter-spacing:1px;font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:justify;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>大规模多轮三维代码数据集</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>基于上述框架，我们筛选构建了包含 5,045 条高质量多轮轨迹的数据集 3DCodeFactory-Data。相比于现有开源数据集普遍局限于几十行代码的单轮静态单物体且缺乏完备验证，3DCodeFactory-Data 全部由通过视觉、规格与交互功能实机验证的长程多轮轨迹构成，在代码规模、交互深度与多物体跨领域场景复杂度上均实现了显著跨越。</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125142308_d0fa71d.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 770px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 770px;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125142308_37d2cbc.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>图3：3DCodeFactory-Data 数据集统计分布</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 50px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>04</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"letter-spacing:1px;font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:justify;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>基准评测与消融分析</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>我们以 Qwen3.5-9B 和 Qwen3.8-27B 为基座开展全参数监督微调，在 BlenderWorld、P3D-Bench、3DCodeBench 与 BlenderGym 四个基准上进行评测。</span></p>\n     <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n      <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>主实验表现：</span></strong><span>基于 3DCodeFactory-Data 微调后，9B 与 27B 模型在全部三个生成基准上均取得大幅提升，其中27B 模型则全面反超同系列 2.4T 旗舰模型 Qwen3.8-Max。相比之下，基于现有开源数据集微调的模型仅在简单单物体上有一定效果，面对复杂场景构建时提升微弱，甚至在跨平台基准上出现性能退化。</span></p>\n      </li>\n     </ul>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125142309_aa48b50.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"></p>\n   <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n    <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>跨模态与场景编辑泛化：</span></strong><span>微调带来的提升并非局限于固定输入格式，而是增强了模型底层的三维空间理解与代码操作能力。一方面，模型在 BlenderWorld 的多类输入模态下均取得稳定提升，即便面对训练集从未见过的视频参考任务也能实现大幅泛化；另一方面，尽管训练集只包含从零构建任务，模型仍能零样本迁移至 BlenderGym 存量场景局部编辑基准，在光照、形变、物体摆放与几何材质修改上显著降低编辑误差。</span></p>\n    </li>\n   </ul>\n   <p></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125142308_000d2ab.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 770px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 770px;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125142309_1adcd45.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"></p>\n   <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n    <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>多维 Rubric 筛选的作用：</span></strong><span>对比在相同任务上未经筛选的等规模随机轨迹，未筛选组在训练中后期增速明显放缓，而经 Rubric 筛选的数据则使模型全程保持稳步提升，在两个参数规模上均取得显著优势。</span></p>\n    </li>\n   </ul>\n   <p></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125142309_831ccdd.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>图4：评分准则筛选前后的训练得分对比</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"></p>\n   <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n    <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>下游实际渲染效果对比：</span></strong><span>在室内场景的多轮构建过程中，基座模型仅搭出粗略几何块便提前停止，而微调后模型在完成空间硬装后，能通过多轮视觉自检持续精修家具与灯具细节。</span></p>\n    </li>\n   </ul>\n   <p></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125142309_1eb4286.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>图5：室内场景同视角多轮构建过程对比</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>在四类基准上，微调后模型在空间结构完整度、几何朝向与局部编辑精度上均得到显著改善。</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125142309_59dd84a.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>图6：四类下游基准微调前后的实际渲染效果对比</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 50px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>05</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"letter-spacing:1px;font-size:20px;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:justify;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>作者简介</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"></p>\n    <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n     <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>王钊予</span></strong></p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>小红书 dots post train 团队算法实习生，主要研究方向为 code agent &amp; visual coding。</span></p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p><strong><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span>温学儒</span></span></strong></p>\n      <p><span><span>小红书 dots post train 团队算法实习生，主要研究方向为 code agent &amp; visual coding。</span></span></p>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n    <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n     <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>连轩</span></strong></p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>小红书 dots post train 团队算法工程师，主要研究方向为 code agent &amp; visual coding。</span></p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>天圣</span></strong></p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>小红书 dots post train 团队负责人。</span></p>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n    <p></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 770px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 770px;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261125142308_bda5501.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "小红书开源了 3DCodeFactory 框架和 5.52B token 的 3D 编程数据集，显著提升了基于 Qwen3.8-27B 的 3D 代码生成模型在复杂场景构建与交互开发方面的性能。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "小红书开源了 3DCodeFactory 框架和 5.52B token 的 3D 编程数据集，显著提升了基于 Qwen3.8-27B 的 3D 代码生成模型在复杂场景构建与交互开发方面的性能。",
  "summary": "本文介绍了小红书提出的大规模全自动 3D 数据合成框架 3DCodeFactory 及其构建的开源数据集 3DCodeFactory-Data。该框架通过三阶段管线：1）构建 10 类 56 类的 3D 分类体系并对齐语料分布；2）以合成参考图为视觉锚点生成结构化需求与多维评分准则；3）通过沙箱实机验证筛选高质量多轮交互轨迹。最终筛选出 5，045 条高质量轨迹，单条平均超过 100 万 tokens，单场景代码量中位数达 4，270 行，总规模达 5.52B tokens。基准测试显示，基于该数据集微调的 Qwen3.8-27B 模型在 BlenderWorld、P3D-Bench、3DCodeBench 等基准上超越同系列 2.4T 旗舰模型 Qwen3.8-Max，显著提升了复杂三维场景构建与交互开发能力。",
